<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $5.5 bln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $5.5 bln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $5.5 billion in overnight reverse repos at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
